[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3728.63, "timestamp": "01:02:08", "text": "嗯…等等，沒有升F鍵，抱歉，是A鍵或B鍵，或是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3734.71, "timestamp": "01:02:14", "text": "我調整"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3737.75, "timestamp": "01:02:17", "text": "音高或旋鈕。 A5 就像切換 C 鍵一樣，A4 就像切換回 C 鍵一樣，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3740.309, "timestamp": "01:02:20", "text": "以前會把 MIDI 鍵盤上的所有按鍵都綁定到按鍵上。然後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3743.99, "timestamp": "01:02:23", "text": "我在Sammy設定了語音指令"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3746.95, "timestamp": "01:02:26", "text": "。你可以像這樣使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3750.39, "timestamp": "01:02:30", "text": "語音指令。  如果有效的話。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3755.43, "timestamp": "01:02:35", "text": "我有一把Launch Valerant步槍、頭盔墊之類的東西。哦，等等。它就那樣聽著。哦，是的，我可以透過語音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3758.63, "timestamp": "01:02:38", "text": "命令之類的方式來"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3762.069, "timestamp": "01:02:42", "text": "觸發這些功能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3770.069, "timestamp": "01:02:50", "text": "。  或者"}]